<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 30.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali confers with Trade Minister Mondher Zenaidi on consumer prices, exports.</p>
<p>- President to chair on Thursday evening a religious talk on the occasion of the holy month of Ramadan.</p>
<p>- President reshuffles ruling party leadership.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia's trade unions organisation condemns the assassination of Algerian top trade union chief Abdelhak Benhamouda.</p>
</text>
